# Keep line endings LF in the repository and in every working tree.
# Without this, a checkout on Windows with core.autocrlf=true converts .go
# files to CRLF, and gofmt then reports every one of them as unformatted
# while CI, which checks out on Linux, stays green. That divergence makes
# `make lint` useless as a local gate exactly where it is needed most.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
